## Maps and data

- [{{ SITE_NAME }}]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/): Start here.
- [Map of Accra and Ghana]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/map): Ghana's 16 regions and Greater Accra's 29 district assemblies, with 2021 census counts, modelled noise layers and an ordinal rent ranking per district.
- [Accra in numbers]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/data): Thirty long-run economic and demographic series, each labelled Ghana-wide, Greater Accra or derived.
- [Flights from Accra]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/flights): Every nonstop route from Kotoka International Airport, with the airlines flying it.
- [What is on in Accra]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/events): Public holidays, computed, and curated annual fixtures with a verification date.
- [Glossary]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/glossary): {{ get_entries('glossary')|list|length }} Ghanaian and Akan terms, acronyms and institutions, defined.
- [All guides]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/guides): The full index, in reading order.
- [Newsletter]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/newsletter): Monthly, on what changed in Accra.
- [About]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/about): Who writes this and why.

## Optional

- [Glossary of Ghanaian terms]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/glossary): Individual definitions live at /glossary/<slug>, for example {{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/glossary/ghana-card and {{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/glossary/trotro.
- [Sitemap]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/sitemap.xml): Every indexable page with its last-modified date.
- [Atom feed]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/feed.xml): New and updated guides.
- [Terms and privacy]({{ CANONICAL_ORIGIN }}/terms): What this site does and does not collect.

